{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9da109de273d75637541f9c808a31bc6a89a17f500b45a54775565ad80af7c39", "ja": "（茜はコスプレグラビア企画で、文化祭のステージに\n立つことになった。本番はもうすぐだ！）", "zh": "（茜要参加一项角色扮演写真企划，登上文化祭的舞台。本番马上就要开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "18e69757c817e10a036b549b5c534345c8f587b4396d720a54df8db265a4a397", "ja": "すぅー……はぁー……。\nすぅー……はぁー……。", "zh": "吸气……呼气……。\n吸气……呼气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c249772a29d1deb3085dfc6e28f93e7130eba2ca690d74be2752764aefc922b4", "ja": "茜……。そうだよな。\n想定よりお客さんも多いし、緊張もするよな。", "zh": "茜……是啊。客人也比预想的多，紧张也是难免的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "a0fc37733b7a036b5b06bb1730f36c4881449a5a6303ebe1566efb2c4d0bb391", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。\n茜ちゃんは気づいてしまったのです……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n小茜注意到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b325040bafc1a5094e782e93b17b628ed377e9b4d8b980409d1a874c8d330b67", "ja": "……えっ？　気づいたって、何に？", "zh": "……诶？你说发现了，发现什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "9d649f7d4795bfa1b95fc76a43bb47561964b1d77370a1d7339fc6b91a566480", "ja": "こんなに人懐こくてかわいいキツネなんて、みんな\nナデナデしたくなっちゃうっ……！！", "zh": "这么亲人又可爱的狐狸，大家都会忍不住想摸摸它……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a45cb6a331a2916cf934dd3d50cd0a68f4d47c498e82196b13333bda2d06d296", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。茜の愛らしさがあれば、\nみんなもキツネに夢中になるかもな。", "zh": "是、是啊……有了茜的可爱，大家说不定也会迷上狐狸呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "face018543710ebaf4eff37c6a8f38e7db3ed693cb4ef0428138a8c73a51cb3e", "ja": "ハッ！　まさか……来てくれたみんなにナデナデして\nもらったら、茜ちゃんのナデナデ欲が満たされて……", "zh": "哈！难道说……要是让来这里的大家摸摸，小茜想被摸摸的欲望就得到满足了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "6e435d54b705d9f0d34ecc6fe7ef05c333b88170e5b2f8a5baeedf6ec36ac0c4", "ja": "この先、茜ちゃんが{$P$}ちゃんに\nナデナデしてもらおうかなって思う日がこなくなる……", "zh": "以后，连想让{$P$}摸摸小茜的日子都不会有了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "d3d67d987480019f1d0fc5856c37158c17c963871cf05b6f5b704c81064f4276", "ja": "そんな可能性があるかもって\n{$P$}ちゃん、心配してる！？", "zh": "难道你是在担心会有这种可能性，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1010_p", "source_sha256": "788bbb5243b092fa4a60df93a4d94f42f2d5428beb3e02284f7c67faed03999a", "ja": "……。その心配はしてないかな。", "zh": "……。倒没在担心那个呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "7f5849c9566e9b8c5658a97be34d85f883f36f873ce036386982e722e2d07ca1", "ja": "にゃッ！？　そこは嘘でもいいから「じつは……\nそうなんだ……」っていうところじゃない！？", "zh": "喵！？　就算是骗我的，也该说一句“其实……确实是这样……”吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1012_p", "source_sha256": "33d033e7138c282aee21bc5e2e6c986c1ab7a2b5272095f83d3737d8a180e746", "ja": "（急に、演技指導が入った……）", "zh": "（突然开始指导演技了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b1657dc5e96d3eae67106282df2c1387362bcc82ced204c6d8ad870b139de465", "ja": "んんっ。じつは……そうなんだ……。", "zh": "咳咳。其实……是这样的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "71290ca9eb1c568e7202e19c1db0b05ab4c703baaff32987ca4c393352660ef4", "ja": "そうだと思った！　{$P$}ちゃんは\n茜ちゃんのこと大好きだもんね☆", "zh": "我就猜到了！{$P$}最喜欢小茜了嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3ab508e96dbc3fd9e2d5476ef3b72c02b9832a5b98a5cea6352d9e5d6c5298c", "ja": "仕方ないニャ～♪　茜ちゃんキツネのナデナデ権利は\n{$P$}ちゃんにあげましょう！", "zh": "没办法喵～♪　就把小茜狐狸的摸摸权利送给{$P$}吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0543_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "f24d6044bd22f29aa1ba01f28ed900e89029660aa141e7e390e262b5bbd06ee1", "ja": "この衣装を着てる間だけ、特別な権利だからね。\nい～っぱいナデナデ、モフモフしちゃってね♪", "zh": "只有穿着这套服装的时候，才有这项特别的权利哦。\n要尽情地摸摸、揉揉软绵绵的尾巴哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
